<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Summon Earth</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Conjurer (guild level 14)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast summon earth</a>
</pre>
<p>The earth opens, and a small earth elemental (level 17) rises to serve you. 
It follows you, fights beside you when you are in a fight, and when your hit 
points drop below a third it tries to rescue you.
</p><p>It doesn't stay long: from half a minute to a minute and a half, longer the 
better your summoning sphere. Then it vanishes in a puff of smoke, dropping 
whatever it carried. If it is killed first, it is gone too. It doesn't take 
orders.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Dust Devil</a>
